(200667, 11653, 4493, '<td valign="top">I almost submitted this same shot! Glad I switched at the 11th hour! Had fun shooting on Saturday, guess we need to discuss what we''re submitting so this doesn''t happen again.<br/> <br/>That being said, nice shot, a little dark and might stand a bit of a unmask sharpen. I like your composition.</td>', 'I almost submitted this same shot! Glad I switched at the 11th hour! Had fun shooting on Saturday, guess we need to discuss what we''re submitting so this doesn''t happen again. That being said, nice shot, a little dark and might stand a bit of a unmask sharpen. I like your composition.', '2003-01-27 00:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
