(200876, 11387, 3459, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the colour.  The way you have managed to have all vertical and horizontal line perfectly alligned is incredible, I know how difficult it can be.  The subdude colours I think is what really makes the image stand out for me though.  A 10!<br/></td>', 'I love the composition and the colour.  The way you have managed to have all vertical and horizontal line perfectly alligned is incredible, I know how difficult it can be.  The subdude colours I think is what really makes the image stand out for me though.  A 10!', '2003-01-27 02:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
