(200977, 11474, 6025, '<td valign="top">Hehe.. A truly creative solution to the problem. I played around with a few goofy puns on "window" and "door" as well, but this is better than anything I could come up with.  Artistically, the limited DOF and the selected sharpness (or is it Photoshop? ;) really does it for me. (9)</td>', 'Hehe.. A truly creative solution to the problem. I played around with a few goofy puns on "window" and "door" as well, but this is better than anything I could come up with.  Artistically, the limited DOF and the selected sharpness (or is it Photoshop? ;) really does it for me. (9)', '2003-01-27 04:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
