(202014, 11496, 3900, '<td valign="top">Something about this kept throwing my visual balance off, but everything seemed to be well cropped.  So I made my window smaller and scrolled through it, and sure enough the front of the door mat doesn''t line up with the other horizontal lines and the tip of the upper arch is off to the right of the tip of the door.  Just minor things, and I don''t guess there is much you can do about it, but I thought I would point them out since they did throw me off a bit.  Anyway, nice colors.</td>', 'Something about this kept throwing my visual balance off, but everything seemed to be well cropped.  So I made my window smaller and scrolled through it, and sure enough the front of the door mat doesn''t line up with the other horizontal lines and the tip of the upper arch is off to the right of the tip of the door.  Just minor things, and I don''t guess there is much you can do about it, but I thought I would point them out since they did throw me off a bit.  Anyway, nice colors.', '2003-01-28 04:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
