(202761, 11546, 3540, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Great colors, nice concept and well shot.  The one thing I don''t like is the difference in colors on the top 2 panes on the bottom outside corners.  I think this one should be up there in the rankings though.  Nice shot. - Inspzil</td>', 'Excellent.  Great colors, nice concept and well shot.  The one thing I don''t like is the difference in colors on the top 2 panes on the bottom outside corners.  I think this one should be up there in the rankings though.  Nice shot. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 04:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(202763, 11609, 3540, '<td valign="top">This tree looks good in this picture, just not in front of the window.  I like the color of the window, but not the desat on the rest of the colors. - Inspzil</td>', 'This tree looks good in this picture, just not in front of the window.  I like the color of the window, but not the desat on the rest of the colors. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 04:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
