(202768, 11568, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a pic that definitely has to be centered if cropped this tight.  I''m glad you didn''t try to use the rule of thirds.  Its a decent shot though not terribly interesting. - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a pic that definitely has to be centered if cropped this tight.  I''m glad you didn''t try to use the rule of thirds.  Its a decent shot though not terribly interesting. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(202770, 11504, 3540, '<td valign="top">First - I think that the windows and doors were generally supposed to be the subjects in this challenge more than backgrounds.  Secondly - This is an outstanding photograph, even if the challenge was only partially met.  I don''t think the top window needs to be here.  It''s more distracting than anything else.  The silhouette is very well done though.  Great capture - Inspzil</td>', 'First - I think that the windows and doors were generally supposed to be the subjects in this challenge more than backgrounds.  Secondly - This is an outstanding photograph, even if the challenge was only partially met.  I don''t think the top window needs to be here.  It''s more distracting than anything else.  The silhouette is very well done though.  Great capture - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(202771, 11577, 3540, '<td valign="top">The cloud effect on this pic isn''t doing it any favors unless it''s covering something up.  The concept is good, the photography is okay as far as I can see.  The clouds don''t do it for me though. - Inspzil</td>', 'The cloud effect on this pic isn''t doing it any favors unless it''s covering something up.  The concept is good, the photography is okay as far as I can see.  The clouds don''t do it for me though. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(202774, 11461, 3540, '<td valign="top">This needs to be a little clearer.  The lighting on the rail is very distracting as well.  If it were me, I would''ve focused on either the door or the windows.  The combination of the 2 would work if those metal grate things above the door weren''t being eyesores. - Inspzil</td>', 'This needs to be a little clearer.  The lighting on the rail is very distracting as well.  If it were me, I would''ve focused on either the door or the windows.  The combination of the 2 would work if those metal grate things above the door weren''t being eyesores. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(202775, 11491, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great concept and good PS skills.  Definitely unique.  The different colors on each side of the window is a great touch.  I really, really wish the color of the house were different though.  Perhaps a brighter color to match the other colors involved.   Great job though - Inspzil</td>', 'Great concept and good PS skills.  Definitely unique.  The different colors on each side of the window is a great touch.  I really, really wish the color of the house were different though.  Perhaps a brighter color to match the other colors involved.   Great job though - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(202776, 11546, 2553, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on it, but there is something "odd" about this photo that just throws me off.  I like the "scene" outside the window though.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on it, but there is something "odd" about this photo that just throws me off.  I like the "scene" outside the window though.', '2003-01-29 05:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(202777, 11524, 3540, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the fisheye effect, but I do like the clouded effect.  Beautiful set of doors.  The columns and wall over the doors in soft focus works very well for this pic methinks.  It really concentrates the viewers attention on the doors.  Well done - Inspzil</td>', 'I really don''t like the fisheye effect, but I do like the clouded effect.  Beautiful set of doors.  The columns and wall over the doors in soft focus works very well for this pic methinks.  It really concentrates the viewers attention on the doors.  Well done - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(202778, 11505, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors.  I''m not sure I like the crop though - Inspzil</td>', 'Awesome colors.  I''m not sure I like the crop though - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(202779, 11362, 2553, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, meets the challenge, but not real high impact for me - sorry I can''t be more specific, it just doesn''t "do" anything for me.</td>', 'Interesting photo, meets the challenge, but not real high impact for me - sorry I can''t be more specific, it just doesn''t "do" anything for me.', '2003-01-29 05:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(202781, 11471, 3540, '<td valign="top">What kind of frame is this?  Not one that is enhancing the pic at all.  White frames with washed out skies are a bad idea.  Kind of eliminates the doubt the whether or not the sky is washed out. - Inspzil</td>', 'What kind of frame is this?  Not one that is enhancing the pic at all.  White frames with washed out skies are a bad idea.  Kind of eliminates the doubt the whether or not the sky is washed out. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(202782, 11645, 3540, '<td valign="top">The picture could use being squared to the horizon.  The concept is pretty good really.  I like the negative filter.  The whites are just a little bright IMO.  This might''ve been better with less contrast. - Inspzil</td>', 'The picture could use being squared to the horizon.  The concept is pretty good really.  I like the negative filter.  The whites are just a little bright IMO.  This might''ve been better with less contrast. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(202783, 11402, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sky color looks very fake.  It may not be fake, but it looks like this building is glued on it.  Awesome building by the way, and very well portrayed here. - Inspzil</td>', 'The sky color looks very fake.  It may not be fake, but it looks like this building is glued on it.  Awesome building by the way, and very well portrayed here. - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
