(202796, 11443, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great window.   Looks like it could''ve used a little more exposure.  I''m not real sure of the crop either.  I think it couldve been cropped tighter.  This might''ve taken care of some of the exposure issues.  I think that the way this scene has been shot, the more exposure would bring out the church a little more.  - Inspzil</td>', 'Great window.   Looks like it could''ve used a little more exposure.  I''m not real sure of the crop either.  I think it couldve been cropped tighter.  This might''ve taken care of some of the exposure issues.  I think that the way this scene has been shot, the more exposure would bring out the church a little more.  - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(202798, 11651, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  Wonderful color and great DOF.  Exposure is near perfect.  I think exposed just a bit more would''ve made this picture better, slightly.  It is excellent as is though. Great photograph and thanks for sharing it - Inspzil</td>', 'Great angle.  Wonderful color and great DOF.  Exposure is near perfect.  I think exposed just a bit more would''ve made this picture better, slightly.  It is excellent as is though. Great photograph and thanks for sharing it - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(202799, 11631, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the foreground stuff.  If this picture were taken from 5 feet further back I think the effect would still be achieved and the foreground stuff not so noticeable - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t like the foreground stuff.  If this picture were taken from 5 feet further back I think the effect would still be achieved and the foreground stuff not so noticeable - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(202801, 11509, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a very good pic with a very creative effect added to make it really exceptional.  Terrific result - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a very good pic with a very creative effect added to make it really exceptional.  Terrific result - Inspzil', '2003-01-29 05:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(202803, 11445, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white treatment; and the angles and lines.  I can see the door handle, so it effectively meets the challenge, but overall, the shot has little impact for me.</td>', 'I like the black and white treatment; and the angles and lines.  I can see the door handle, so it effectively meets the challenge, but overall, the shot has little impact for me.', '2003-01-29 05:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(202804, 11471, 2553, '<td valign="top">Has kind of a storybook feel to it.  I like the old building and cart.  The greenery and flowers add to that feel, but at the same time they don''t look like they belong there.  I''m "iffy" about the "lost edges" treatment, and I really don''t care for the whole "curly-q" thing that''s going on.</td>', 'Has kind of a storybook feel to it.  I like the old building and cart.  The greenery and flowers add to that feel, but at the same time they don''t look like they belong there.  I''m "iffy" about the "lost edges" treatment, and I really don''t care for the whole "curly-q" thing that''s going on.', '2003-01-29 05:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(202805, 11586, 2553, '<td valign="top">Technically meets the challenge; nice clear shot with good focus; some pretty harsh shadows, but they don''t really hurt the shot;  just not sure about the composition.</td>', 'Technically meets the challenge; nice clear shot with good focus; some pretty harsh shadows, but they don''t really hurt the shot;  just not sure about the composition.', '2003-01-29 05:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(202806, 11540, 2553, '<td valign="top">A building with a lot of "character"; odd how the windows are painted.  Composition lacks impact for me.</td>', 'A building with a lot of "character"; odd how the windows are painted.  Composition lacks impact for me.', '2003-01-29 05:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(202807, 11669, 2553, '<td valign="top">Unique take on the challenge.  I find it odd to be looking at a "floating" car door, the shot feels somewhat surreal.</td>', 'Unique take on the challenge.  I find it odd to be looking at a "floating" car door, the shot feels somewhat surreal.', '2003-01-29 06:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(202809, 11576, 2553, '<td valign="top">The board hanging down gives it kind of an optical illusion feel.  I like the composition, and the reflections in the glass.  Especially like the broken pane, and what looks like rusty hinges.  Not real high impact for me, but I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'The board hanging down gives it kind of an optical illusion feel.  I like the composition, and the reflections in the glass.  Especially like the broken pane, and what looks like rusty hinges.  Not real high impact for me, but I like it nonetheless.', '2003-01-29 06:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(202810, 11512, 2553, '<td valign="top">Not real crazy about this shot.  The car window itself is fairly unspectacular, and I can''t really see the windows on the buildings well.  The reflections in the car window are somewhat indistinct, so that doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  I find the composition to be distracting.  Did you try a closeup of the window, cropping out some of the distractions, and giving a more dynamic look at the reflections?</td>', 'Not real crazy about this shot.  The car window itself is fairly unspectacular, and I can''t really see the windows on the buildings well.  The reflections in the car window are somewhat indistinct, so that doesn''t really add anything to the shot.  I find the composition to be distracting.  Did you try a closeup of the window, cropping out some of the distractions, and giving a more dynamic look at the reflections?', '2003-01-29 06:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(202812, 11577, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of "eye" closeups at all; however, the softening of the shot, along with the "window" in the eye make this one tolerable.  I don''t like the extension of the cloud treatment to the border, I think that a solid border would have been more effective.</td>', 'I am not a fan of "eye" closeups at all; however, the softening of the shot, along with the "window" in the eye make this one tolerable.  I don''t like the extension of the cloud treatment to the border, I think that a solid border would have been more effective.', '2003-01-29 06:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(202813, 11431, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the scene outside the window, with the light and shadows.  I would have much preferred a close up on the window cutting out the distracting surrounding areas.</td>', 'I like the scene outside the window, with the light and shadows.  I would have much preferred a close up on the window cutting out the distracting surrounding areas.', '2003-01-29 06:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(202814, 11645, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, don''t care for the negative treatment.</td>', 'Love the idea, don''t care for the negative treatment.', '2003-01-29 06:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(202815, 11524, 2553, '<td valign="top">This architecture is so beautiful that I think your "treatment" hurts the shot.  I would have loved to have seen this in nice sharp detail, and without all the distortion.  I do like the black and white though.</td>', 'This architecture is so beautiful that I think your "treatment" hurts the shot.  I would have loved to have seen this in nice sharp detail, and without all the distortion.  I do like the black and white though.', '2003-01-29 06:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(202817, 11629, 2553, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see the window as the subject, not the dog.  He/she is adorable, but I think I would have opted for a shot taken from outside, showing the window, with the dog looking out.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see the window as the subject, not the dog.  He/she is adorable, but I think I would have opted for a shot taken from outside, showing the window, with the dog looking out.', '2003-01-29 06:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(202818, 11433, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, except for the composition.  I would have much preferred to see the entire top part of the window cropped out, just below the metal hardware, giving the shot a richer, more abstract feel.</td>', 'I really like this shot, except for the composition.  I would have much preferred to see the entire top part of the window cropped out, just below the metal hardware, giving the shot a richer, more abstract feel.', '2003-01-29 06:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(202819, 11357, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice tattoo, but I''ve never seen feet that hairy.</td>', 'Nice tattoo, but I''ve never seen feet that hairy.', '2003-01-29 06:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(202821, 11364, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like closeups of eyes like this.  That aside, I would have been happier to see an actual reflection of a window in the eye.  I know about the whole "window to the soul" thing, but in the case of this challenge, I am leaning toward a more traditional interpretation.</td>', 'I really don''t like closeups of eyes like this.  That aside, I would have been happier to see an actual reflection of a window in the eye.  I know about the whole "window to the soul" thing, but in the case of this challenge, I am leaning toward a more traditional interpretation.', '2003-01-29 06:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(202823, 11469, 2553, '<td valign="top">There is a window in the shot, but the window, to me, is not the subject.  For me, all of the things in the shot are detracting from the presence of the window, not enhancing it. I do like your lighting and focus in the shot.</td>', 'There is a window in the shot, but the window, to me, is not the subject.  For me, all of the things in the shot are detracting from the presence of the window, not enhancing it. I do like your lighting and focus in the shot.', '2003-01-29 06:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(202824, 11416, 2553, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred a closeup vertical of the doors and the windows.  I love the stained glass reflection in the one window and the person in the other.  I want the windows to have more impact.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred a closeup vertical of the doors and the windows.  I love the stained glass reflection in the one window and the person in the other.  I want the windows to have more impact.', '2003-01-29 06:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(202826, 11642, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot, almost too bright for me.  I like the arched windows and doorway, and would have loved to have seen a shot of them without the distraction of the trees.</td>', 'Nice clear shot, almost too bright for me.  I like the arched windows and doorway, and would have loved to have seen a shot of them without the distraction of the trees.', '2003-01-29 06:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
