(203031, 11645, 5898, '<td valign="top">Like the negative art, but I have never been a person who likes straight on pictures. Try different points of views next challenge and my vote will be higher. (6) John Gill</td>', 'Like the negative art, but I have never been a person who likes straight on pictures. Try different points of views next challenge and my vote will be higher. (6) John Gill', '2003-01-29 11:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(203033, 11433, 5898, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of your photograph makes it very appealing. I really like the angle you took your photo, the lighting, the way the lines work together and the shapes and forms. The colors really set it appart from other works. Excellent! (10) John Gill</td>', 'The simplicity of your photograph makes it very appealing. I really like the angle you took your photo, the lighting, the way the lines work together and the shapes and forms. The colors really set it appart from other works. Excellent! (10) John Gill', '2003-01-29 11:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(203036, 11493, 5898, '<td valign="top">Great find! The texture of the paint, the sign, the old curtain, all make for a great picture. One point deducted for shooting straight on. Try a different point of view for more creativity. One man''s opinion. (9) John Gill</td>', 'Great find! The texture of the paint, the sign, the old curtain, all make for a great picture. One point deducted for shooting straight on. Try a different point of view for more creativity. One man''s opinion. (9) John Gill', '2003-01-29 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(203038, 11523, 5898, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view, texture, shape and form, and lines all work in your favor. (8) John Gill</td>', 'Nice point of view, texture, shape and form, and lines all work in your favor. (8) John Gill', '2003-01-29 11:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(203039, 11441, 5898, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but lacks the creative touch I like in photographs. (6)</td>', 'Nice image, but lacks the creative touch I like in photographs. (6)', '2003-01-29 11:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(203041, 11471, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  <br/>Comment editted - My BAD.  I did not enter this challenge and did not see the extra rules for it.  Sorry.  Awesome shot!  Love the curly things.  10 Swash<br/>(please for give a dumb old man!)</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Comment editted - My BAD.  I did not enter this challenge and did not see the extra rules for it.  Sorry.  Awesome shot!  Love the curly things.  10 Swash(please for give a dumb old man!)', '2003-01-29 12:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(203042, 11509, 5898, '<td valign="top">Really like the point of view, shapes and forms, the tie in with the name of the building, light, and title. The distortion of the lower part of the image, especially the pole, is not appealing to me. I don''t know if that was intended or not but it will cost you one point. Other wise excellent. (9) John Gill <br/></td>', 'Really like the point of view, shapes and forms, the tie in with the name of the building, light, and title. The distortion of the lower part of the image, especially the pole, is not appealing to me. I don''t know if that was intended or not but it will cost you one point. Other wise excellent. (9) John Gill ', '2003-01-29 12:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(203043, 11364, 5898, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I like the thinking outside the box, but this image has been over used.</td>', 'Nice photo, I like the thinking outside the box, but this image has been over used.', '2003-01-29 12:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(203045, 11662, 5898, '<td valign="top">Nice point of view that gives the building a good perspective. Lacks creativity and the brown border does nothing.</td>', 'Nice point of view that gives the building a good perspective. Lacks creativity and the brown border does nothing.', '2003-01-29 12:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(203046, 11461, 5898, '<td valign="top">Lack of depth of field caused the images closest and farthest away to be out of focus. Some times this can not be helped do the the camera''s capabilities. Also when I viewed your picture I cropped the image off just below the yellow wall and I like the picture much better. I like the shot with all it''s lines, shapes and forms, and point of view. Good luck. John Gill</td>', 'Lack of depth of field caused the images closest and farthest away to be out of focus. Some times this can not be helped do the the camera''s capabilities. Also when I viewed your picture I cropped the image off just below the yellow wall and I like the picture much better. I like the shot with all it''s lines, shapes and forms, and point of view. Good luck. John Gill', '2003-01-29 12:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(203047, 11454, 5898, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections, color, and meeting the challenge. Very good. (8) John Gill</td>', 'Nice reflections, color, and meeting the challenge. Very good. (8) John Gill', '2003-01-29 12:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(203049, 11458, 5898, '<td valign="top">Good idea and manipulation.  (7)</td>', 'Good idea and manipulation.  (7)', '2003-01-29 12:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(203050, 11639, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  nice church building, i love stainglass window.  the gates are rather distracting in this shot, even though i understand they are the focus of you shot.  the strong light/shadow contrast suggests you took this photo during the daytime, maybe earlier in the morning or later in the afternoon (if that was possible with your schedule) would''ve softened the shadows some.</td>', 'challenge met.  nice church building, i love stainglass window.  the gates are rather distracting in this shot, even though i understand they are the focus of you shot.  the strong light/shadow contrast suggests you took this photo during the daytime, maybe earlier in the morning or later in the afternoon (if that was possible with your schedule) would''ve softened the shadows some.', '2003-01-29 12:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(203051, 11642, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  high-key works here.  i love the colorful roof tiles and the blue sky.  the composition is ok, too, nothing overwhelming, but then again, i don''t know how i would''ve changed it, either.  i do like the inclusing of the trees.</td>', 'challenge met.  high-key works here.  i love the colorful roof tiles and the blue sky.  the composition is ok, too, nothing overwhelming, but then again, i don''t know how i would''ve changed it, either.  i do like the inclusing of the trees.', '2003-01-29 12:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(203053, 11510, 5898, '<td valign="top">I like!!! I would not change the picture in any way. Simplicity sometimes is the best. (10) John Gill</td>', 'I like!!! I would not change the picture in any way. Simplicity sometimes is the best. (10) John Gill', '2003-01-29 12:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(203064, 11381, 806, '<td valign="top">I think this could have benefitted by a square crop to remove some of the excess red.</td>', 'I think this could have benefitted by a square crop to remove some of the excess red.', '2003-01-29 12:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(203070, 11661, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i like how you isolated just the reds in this shot and desaturated everything else.  nice repeating patterns.  did you consider closing in on them a little more?  maybe cropping out everything around the main building and just have that be the photo ... i think i would like that, but that''s just me personally  :)</td>', 'challenge met.  i like how you isolated just the reds in this shot and desaturated everything else.  nice repeating patterns.  did you consider closing in on them a little more?  maybe cropping out everything around the main building and just have that be the photo ... i think i would like that, but that''s just me personally  :)', '2003-01-29 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(203073, 11631, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met, but not with a totally appealing pic IMHO.  a little more contrast would''ve given the pic more "pop" and i also don''t like the harsh shadows (from flash?) but it''s hard to say how to change that w/out being there.  doesn''t exactly look like a place that has electricity.  maybe focus more on the door, use a tripod and some portable light if at all possible.</td>', 'challenge met, but not with a totally appealing pic IMHO.  a little more contrast would''ve given the pic more "pop" and i also don''t like the harsh shadows (from flash?) but it''s hard to say how to change that w/out being there.  doesn''t exactly look like a place that has electricity.  maybe focus more on the door, use a tripod and some portable light if at all possible.', '2003-01-29 13:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(203099, 11580, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful piece!  If not inverse coloration, it seems close to it.  The doors seem grainy, but I think that''s your post processing.  The arches above the door are perfect!  I think I could have lived with the bottom of the doors being the bottom of the photo and (impossible wish) the little bricks in the upper corners, but what are you to do?   (Maybe a higher, more straight on shot???)  9 Swash</td>', 'This is a wonderful piece!  If not inverse coloration, it seems close to it.  The doors seem grainy, but I think that''s your post processing.  The arches above the door are perfect!  I think I could have lived with the bottom of the doors being the bottom of the photo and (impossible wish) the little bricks in the upper corners, but what are you to do?   (Maybe a higher, more straight on shot???)  9 Swash', '2003-01-29 14:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(203178, 11474, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken shot, narrow DOF works very well in this case.  This is a wildly different "take" on the challenge topic (so creative in that respect), but visually, not that appealing.  6 Swash</td>', 'Very well taken shot, narrow DOF works very well in this case.  This is a wildly different "take" on the challenge topic (so creative in that respect), but visually, not that appealing.  6 Swash', '2003-01-29 16:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203179, 11631, 1005, '<td valign="top">Mostly well taken photo, there''s at least two doors, so challenge well met.  The two foreground items are a bit distracting (the bar of wood coming from the bottom of the frame - and the part of the door leaning on the wall on the right side of the frame).  Plus the shadows created by the flash aren''t very appealing (don''t add anything but maybe a bit of depth).  Visually, I don''t care for it, sorry, it just doesn''t appeal to me.  6 Swash</td>', 'Mostly well taken photo, there''s at least two doors, so challenge well met.  The two foreground items are a bit distracting (the bar of wood coming from the bottom of the frame - and the part of the door leaning on the wall on the right side of the frame).  Plus the shadows created by the flash aren''t very appealing (don''t add anything but maybe a bit of depth).  Visually, I don''t care for it, sorry, it just doesn''t appeal to me.  6 Swash', '2003-01-29 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203181, 11498, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice building shot, the two seagulls are a big plus.  Contrast is good, but the sky didn''t seem to take the black and white well, it appears between grainy and very grainy.  It''s a nice building with neat trimmings, but it doesn''t "grab" me visually.  <br/>6 Swash</td>', 'Nice building shot, the two seagulls are a big plus.  Contrast is good, but the sky didn''t seem to take the black and white well, it appears between grainy and very grainy.  It''s a nice building with neat trimmings, but it doesn''t "grab" me visually.  6 Swash', '2003-01-29 16:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(203232, 11364, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot.  Light is a tad bit harsh for my taste.</td>', 'This is a good shot.  Light is a tad bit harsh for my taste.', '2003-01-29 18:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(203233, 11651, 3447, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  Wild color.  Practice your border skills some more - with no limitations you can mask and frame more effectively.  High score.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  Wild color.  Practice your border skills some more - with no limitations you can mask and frame more effectively.  High score.', '2003-01-29 18:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(203235, 11404, 4514, '<td valign="top">There is something lacking here and right off the bat I cannot put my finger on it. <br/></td>', 'There is something lacking here and right off the bat I cannot put my finger on it. ', '2003-01-29 18:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(203236, 11381, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  I think the light is good.  Bravo</td>', 'This is wonderful.  I think the light is good.  Bravo', '2003-01-29 18:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(203237, 11454, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is nice.</td>', 'This is nice.', '2003-01-29 18:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(203238, 11525, 4514, '<td valign="top">Not a bad picture.  Model has broken wrists.  That is good non static pose</td>', 'Not a bad picture.  Model has broken wrists.  That is good non static pose', '2003-01-29 18:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(203239, 11363, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is a very good shot.  The lines of conposition are very nice.</td>', 'This is a very good shot.  The lines of conposition are very nice.', '2003-01-29 18:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203241, 11489, 4514, '<td valign="top">This is better than average.  6  :-)</td>', 'This is better than average.  6  :-)', '2003-01-29 18:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(203242, 11661, 4514, '<td valign="top">Intresting effect.  Picture is a bit cluttered.</td>', 'Intresting effect.  Picture is a bit cluttered.', '2003-01-29 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(203243, 11468, 3447, '<td valign="top">Well done! Color really jumps, and focus is tack sharp.  Now that BORDERS are considered part of a photographers skill at DPC - why no really fancy border?<br/>Nontheless, you get a high vote for photo and processing.</td>', 'Well done! Color really jumps, and focus is tack sharp.  Now that BORDERS are considered part of a photographers skill at DPC - why no really fancy border?Nontheless, you get a high vote for photo and processing.', '2003-01-29 18:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(203244, 11357, 4514, '<td valign="top">Is your left foot that hairy????  Or is this the ridge above the two ankles?  Anyway.  I doubt this shot will be copied in this challenge.  :-)</td>', 'Is your left foot that hairy????  Or is this the ridge above the two ankles?  Anyway.  I doubt this shot will be copied in this challenge.  :-)', '2003-01-29 18:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(203245, 11464, 4514, '<td valign="top">Dark though very intresting.</td>', 'Dark though very intresting.', '2003-01-29 18:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(203247, 11461, 4514, '<td valign="top">The flash on the Cam provides for an affect that is not natural to light on the Rod Iron.  I would try to use a sock over the flash to reduce harshness of light then reshoot and see if it turns out better.<br/></td>', 'The flash on the Cam provides for an affect that is not natural to light on the Rod Iron.  I would try to use a sock over the flash to reduce harshness of light then reshoot and see if it turns out better.', '2003-01-29 18:21:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(203249, 11493, 4514, '<td valign="top">What a perfectly free way to advertise.  DP Challenge.  Now that is motivation.  Clever thinking.  Any takers yet???</td>', 'What a perfectly free way to advertise.  DP Challenge.  Now that is motivation.  Clever thinking.  Any takers yet???', '2003-01-29 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(203250, 11404, 3447, '<td valign="top">It was a dark and stormy night....      Good, stark photo with lots of windows.  Would have liked more DOF if possible, but it rates a strong vote.</td>', 'It was a dark and stormy night....      Good, stark photo with lots of windows.  Would have liked more DOF if possible, but it rates a strong vote.', '2003-01-29 18:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(203253, 11540, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good focus and color (well taken shot).  The window frames are bizarrely painted (just noting it, no score effect).  For a second, I thought you might be going for an optical illusion with the angle of the shot and framing, but honestly, they look the same size.  The reflections in the window glass and the colorful curtains work against each other to confuse the viewer (me).  6 Swash</td>', 'Very good focus and color (well taken shot).  The window frames are bizarrely painted (just noting it, no score effect).  For a second, I thought you might be going for an optical illusion with the angle of the shot and framing, but honestly, they look the same size.  The reflections in the window glass and the colorful curtains work against each other to confuse the viewer (me).  6 Swash', '2003-01-29 18:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(203255, 11669, 1005, '<td valign="top">From the lines of the web and other edges, I think the focus seems good, but the color manipulation (at least I hope that''s from post processing) distorts the image so that I''m not fully certain.  (joke:  what happened to the rest of the vehicle?)  To me, this is overly processed...it looks more like a well done painting than a photo.  (Was that your objective???)  6 Swash</td>', 'From the lines of the web and other edges, I think the focus seems good, but the color manipulation (at least I hope that''s from post processing) distorts the image so that I''m not fully certain.  (joke:  what happened to the rest of the vehicle?)  To me, this is overly processed...it looks more like a well done painting than a photo.  (Was that your objective???)  6 Swash', '2003-01-29 18:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(203277, 11498, 2716, '<td valign="top">great angle.  I loeve the grainyness of the sky.  Good job. Jacko.  9</td>', 'great angle.  I loeve the grainyness of the sky.  Good job. Jacko.  9', '2003-01-29 18:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(203278, 11505, 3447, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.  Lovely enhancement of stained glass as well as excellent composition in cropping.  You even get high marks for your tasteful border.  10  JEM</td>', 'Very, very nice.  Lovely enhancement of stained glass as well as excellent composition in cropping.  You even get high marks for your tasteful border.  10  JEM', '2003-01-29 19:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(203279, 11426, 2716, '<td valign="top">What a great photo.  You really over did it in Photoshop, sot guess what, I''ll give you a 10.  Good luck.  Excellent work.  10</td>', 'What a great photo.  You really over did it in Photoshop, sot guess what, I''ll give you a 10.  Good luck.  Excellent work.  10', '2003-01-29 19:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(203284, 11402, 3447, '<td valign="top">Strong image.  Door and windows really secondary, but do fit challenge.  Not sure about angle of presentation but it does catch the eye.   9   JEM</td>', 'Strong image.  Door and windows really secondary, but do fit challenge.  Not sure about angle of presentation but it does catch the eye.   9   JEM', '2003-01-29 19:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(203286, 11645, 3447, '<td valign="top">This makes an interesting and graphic photo.  I have not been brave enough to use the negative aspect as yet.  Good number for you.</td>', 'This makes an interesting and graphic photo.  I have not been brave enough to use the negative aspect as yet.  Good number for you.', '2003-01-29 19:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(203287, 11661, 1005, '<td valign="top">Color nicely manipulated out, except the red (did you mean to have the dumpster''s label show up, too?)  Focus is very good, sharp!  (yes, the telephone wires look jagged, but that''s not your fault or even the camera''s!)  6 Swash</td>', 'Color nicely manipulated out, except the red (did you mean to have the dumpster''s label show up, too?)  Focus is very good, sharp!  (yes, the telephone wires look jagged, but that''s not your fault or even the camera''s!)  6 Swash', '2003-01-29 19:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(203290, 11537, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat window, lots of negative space to focus attention back up to the window.  Contrast is pretty good.  The shading of the blank wall takes away from the effect of offering the negative space.  6 Swash</td>', 'Neat window, lots of negative space to focus attention back up to the window.  Contrast is pretty good.  The shading of the blank wall takes away from the effect of offering the negative space.  6 Swash', '2003-01-29 19:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(203292, 11441, 3447, '<td valign="top">Good afternoon color, and clear background.  If this is really an occupied house, the residents are tougher than I am.  I like this photograph for subject, composition and color.</td>', 'Good afternoon color, and clear background.  If this is really an occupied house, the residents are tougher than I am.  I like this photograph for subject, composition and color.', '2003-01-29 19:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(203295, 11363, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp!  Great contrasts.  Shooting from dark to light (or vice versa) is very hard, but you pulled this off very well!!  I''m not fully involved with the shot (lower interest), but it''s much better than the 7 I started with.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very sharp!  Great contrasts.  Shooting from dark to light (or vice versa) is very hard, but you pulled this off very well!!  I''m not fully involved with the shot (lower interest), but it''s much better than the 7 I started with.  8 Swash', '2003-01-29 19:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(203296, 11636, 3447, '<td valign="top">Strong architectural graphics.  European?  Would like to see top of roof shapes - hedge shapes extraneous.  Good score.</td>', 'Strong architectural graphics.  European?  Would like to see top of roof shapes - hedge shapes extraneous.  Good score.', '2003-01-29 19:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(203297, 11642, 1005, '<td valign="top">Gosh, it looks WARM there!  (brrrr)  I love the roof, very, very colorful.  I don''t know what to suggest, but the white walls overpower the rest of this shot just a little too much (IMO).  I like the mini-palm trees, cute!  7 Swash</td>', 'Gosh, it looks WARM there!  (brrrr)  I love the roof, very, very colorful.  I don''t know what to suggest, but the white walls overpower the rest of this shot just a little too much (IMO).  I like the mini-palm trees, cute!  7 Swash', '2003-01-29 19:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(203299, 11625, 3447, '<td valign="top">This good sharp photograph typefies too much of the American population''s attitude when the shooting stops:  "Let us forget the blood and sacrifice of these men, and quickly return to our nice comfortable lives".<br/>High mark for your photograph.</td>', 'This good sharp photograph typefies too much of the American population''s attitude when the shooting stops:  "Let us forget the blood and sacrifice of these men, and quickly return to our nice comfortable lives".High mark for your photograph.', '2003-01-29 19:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(203302, 11443, 3447, '<td valign="top">You were headed in the right direction.  Either to zoom on the stained glass, or, boldly walk up closer for your photograph.  Good effort.</td>', 'You were headed in the right direction.  Either to zoom on the stained glass, or, boldly walk up closer for your photograph.  Good effort.', '2003-01-29 19:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(203304, 11536, 3447, '<td valign="top">Excellent architectural photograph.  I like the strong light and shadows and, of course, the contrast of curves with geometric angles.     9     JEM</td>', 'Excellent architectural photograph.  I like the strong light and shadows and, of course, the contrast of curves with geometric angles.     9     JEM', '2003-01-29 19:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(203308, 11471, 3447, '<td valign="top">Jolly strange residential cottage.  I see a hay barn with the hayloft door for loading hay bales in and out - having done a good bit of that in my youth.  Still, a nice photograph with flowers and sharp focus.  High marks.    JEM</td>', 'Jolly strange residential cottage.  I see a hay barn with the hayloft door for loading hay bales in and out - having done a good bit of that in my youth.  Still, a nice photograph with flowers and sharp focus.  High marks.    JEM', '2003-01-29 19:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(203310, 11482, 3447, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and color - even border already.  You did not permit yourself to get out of hand with the LOOSE permissive DPC rules for this challenge.  High mark.<br/>  JEM</td>', 'Very nice composition and color - even border already.  You did not permit yourself to get out of hand with the LOOSE permissive DPC rules for this challenge.  High mark.  JEM', '2003-01-29 19:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203314, 11387, 3447, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and grain in wood.  Tells a story of better times now gone.</td>', 'Nice texture and grain in wood.  Tells a story of better times now gone.', '2003-01-29 20:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(203322, 11603, 3447, '<td valign="top">Good composition and crop.  Color might have been intensified a bit for DPC voters.<br/>Good Mexico street scene.      JEM</td>', 'Good composition and crop.  Color might have been intensified a bit for DPC voters.Good Mexico street scene.      JEM', '2003-01-29 20:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(203330, 11523, 3447, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective and sharp focus.  No gee-whiz post processing.   JEM</td>', 'Like the perspective and sharp focus.  No gee-whiz post processing.   JEM', '2003-01-29 20:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(203337, 11537, 3447, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this better if windows were positioned lower in photo frame.  Somehow they seem a bit scrunched at top.  Good sharp photograph.</td>', 'Would have liked this better if windows were positioned lower in photo frame.  Somehow they seem a bit scrunched at top.  Good sharp photograph.', '2003-01-29 20:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(203349, 11642, 3447, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful inspiration for all those folks in the frozen northlands.  Maybe a bit overboosted, but still appealing.  Compliments on your border restraint.   JEM</td>', 'What a wonderful inspiration for all those folks in the frozen northlands.  Maybe a bit overboosted, but still appealing.  Compliments on your border restraint.   JEM', '2003-01-29 20:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(203355, 11363, 3447, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph.   Strong mark.</td>', 'Excellent photograph.   Strong mark.', '2003-01-29 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(203366, 11623, 3447, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph.  Authentic colors and subject.  No black box manipulation, and not even an elaborate border.  Congratulations.      9      JEM</td>', 'Very nice photograph.  Authentic colors and subject.  No black box manipulation, and not even an elaborate border.  Congratulations.      9      JEM', '2003-01-29 20:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(203370, 11666, 3447, '<td valign="top">An excellent example of graphic architecture - without excessive post-processing.</td>', 'An excellent example of graphic architecture - without excessive post-processing.', '2003-01-29 20:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(203399, 11453, 3447, '<td valign="top">Excellent, sharp photograph of this old house.  You will get whines about the dark shadow, and why didn''t you use a reflector or three strobe lights for fill.  Good for you for submitting an actual photograph - not even a sexed up border.   8   JEM</td>', 'Excellent, sharp photograph of this old house.  You will get whines about the dark shadow, and why didn''t you use a reflector or three strobe lights for fill.  Good for you for submitting an actual photograph - not even a sexed up border.   8   JEM', '2003-01-29 20:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(203421, 11445, 5898, '<td valign="top">Like the perspective, refreshing. The simplicity works also. A little more contrast maybe? Nice shot. (7)</td>', 'Like the perspective, refreshing. The simplicity works also. A little more contrast maybe? Nice shot. (7)', '2003-01-29 21:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(203422, 11624, 5898, '<td valign="top">Good take on the challenge, like the shadow, nice touch. (8)</td>', 'Good take on the challenge, like the shadow, nice touch. (8)', '2003-01-29 21:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
