(203872, 11549, 3447, '<td valign="top">Well done.    9</td>', 'Well done.    9', '2003-01-30 15:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(203900, 11536, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the elegance of the curves in this shot.  Wonderful in bw.</td>', 'I love the elegance of the curves in this shot.  Wonderful in bw.', '2003-01-30 16:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(203908, 11488, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very nice old and rustic look.  I really like the way the sidewalk leads your eyes up to the door.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice old and rustic look.  I really like the way the sidewalk leads your eyes up to the door.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-30 16:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(203913, 11445, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting angle of a door.  I like this photo a lot but I can honestly say the border really hurts this photo.  They don''t compliment each other well in my opinion.  I like the the B&amp;W.  No border or one that isn''t so obstrusive and you get a higher score from me.  Good work and luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very interesting angle of a door.  I like this photo a lot but I can honestly say the border really hurts this photo.  They don''t compliment each other well in my opinion.  I like the the B&W.  No border or one that isn''t so obstrusive and you get a higher score from me.  Good work and luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-30 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(203920, 11362, 811, '<td valign="top">The composition here is static to me, because the shot is straight on, and it is so centered.    However, I think it is an awesome idea.  I''m not crazy about wild things in post processing, but yours is one that I feel has been done very well.  It enhances the photo, without being overbearing.  Good work.</td>', 'The composition here is static to me, because the shot is straight on, and it is so centered.    However, I think it is an awesome idea.  I''m not crazy about wild things in post processing, but yours is one that I feel has been done very well.  It enhances the photo, without being overbearing.  Good work.', '2003-01-30 16:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(203923, 11402, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this, and I like how it looks crowded at the top, though ordinarily I wouldn''t.  Great colors and capture!</td>', 'I love the perspective on this, and I like how it looks crowded at the top, though ordinarily I wouldn''t.  Great colors and capture!', '2003-01-30 16:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203924, 11489, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the character and hominess to this window.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I like the character and hominess to this window.  Very nicely done.', '2003-01-30 16:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(203925, 11629, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and I love the "emotion" on his face.  Hope you gave him a doggie biscuit or something for posing.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and I love the "emotion" on his face.  Hope you gave him a doggie biscuit or something for posing.', '2003-01-30 16:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(203926, 11644, 811, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and framing.  I wish you could have captured this when the shadows in the front were a touch longer.  That would have added to the desolate feeling, I think.  Nevertheless, wonderful capture.<br/></td>', 'Wonderful composition and framing.  I wish you could have captured this when the shadows in the front were a touch longer.  That would have added to the desolate feeling, I think.  Nevertheless, wonderful capture.', '2003-01-30 16:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(203932, 11491, 3599, '<td valign="top">One of the coolest shots I''ve seen this week.  I don''t know how this was done its neat.  Good luck in this week.</td>', 'One of the coolest shots I''ve seen this week.  I don''t know how this was done its neat.  Good luck in this week.', '2003-01-30 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(203936, 11622, 3599, '<td valign="top">I don''t know the saying so I don''t understand the title.  That has no affect on my voting though.  I will say that the glare off the &amp;Trust is quite distracting but other than that a nice photo.</td>', 'I don''t know the saying so I don''t understand the title.  That has no affect on my voting though.  I will say that the glare off the &Trust is quite distracting but other than that a nice photo.', '2003-01-30 17:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(203938, 11639, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  The border compliments the colors in the photo well.  I don''t particulary like the shadows on the gate.  I don''t like the little bit of tree sticking out of the left side either.  But since you can''t just chainsaw a tree down maybe waiting until earlier or later in the day depending on the direction to get the sunlight lower and not cast the shadows.  Just a thought, still a very nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  The border compliments the colors in the photo well.  I don''t particulary like the shadows on the gate.  I don''t like the little bit of tree sticking out of the left side either.  But since you can''t just chainsaw a tree down maybe waiting until earlier or later in the day depending on the direction to get the sunlight lower and not cast the shadows.  Just a thought, still a very nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-30 17:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(203943, 11489, 1041, '<td valign="top">it''s always a pleasure for me to see something that''s obiously from sweden ... i lived in stockholm for 4.5 years and loved every second there! :)  anyway, you met the challenge.  i really like the old weathered look of the wood, the metal of the window frames, and then the cozy contrast of the flowers in the window and the nice sign that hilding (name? noun? never heard that one) lives there.  there''s really nothing i can add to a nice photo  :)</td>', 'it''s always a pleasure for me to see something that''s obiously from sweden ... i lived in stockholm for 4.5 years and loved every second there! :)  anyway, you met the challenge.  i really like the old weathered look of the wood, the metal of the window frames, and then the cozy contrast of the flowers in the window and the nice sign that hilding (name? noun? never heard that one) lives there.  there''s really nothing i can add to a nice photo  :)', '2003-01-30 17:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(203958, 11629, 6504, '<td valign="top">I vote this number one.  Look at the expression in the dog''s eye.</td>', 'I vote this number one.  Look at the expression in the dog''s eye.', '2003-01-30 18:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(203977, 11636, 6035, '<td valign="top">I like the geometry here, and it''s very clean, almost seems computer generated. The roof is a bit odd where it''s cut, but i can look past that :)</td>', 'I like the geometry here, and it''s very clean, almost seems computer generated. The roof is a bit odd where it''s cut, but i can look past that :)', '2003-01-30 20:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(203981, 11603, 6035, '<td valign="top">Ah, very nice. I love the colors here. The blue is juuust right, and the leaves are a very nice green, though a bit dark. The door is nice too (that is what this contest is about right? :) )</td>', 'Ah, very nice. I love the colors here. The blue is juuust right, and the leaves are a very nice green, though a bit dark. The door is nice too (that is what this contest is about right? :) )', '2003-01-30 20:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(204045, 11364, 5475, '<td valign="top">I knew there would be an eye shot as a window to the soul this week.  I didn''t know, however, it would be this good of an eyeshot! I like that you chose black and white.  The detail and clarity is amazing to me.  I''d be interested in what equipment you used, lighting, etc.  Great job! 9</td>', 'I knew there would be an eye shot as a window to the soul this week.  I didn''t know, however, it would be this good of an eyeshot! I like that you chose black and white.  The detail and clarity is amazing to me.  I''d be interested in what equipment you used, lighting, etc.  Great job! 9', '2003-01-30 22:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(204090, 11453, 2182, '<td valign="top">Captured all the beauty of this fine old home</td>', 'Captured all the beauty of this fine old home', '2003-01-31 00:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(204096, 11357, 2011, '<td valign="top">Very cool tat, and original take on the challenge. Plus I love a die hard rock and roller. I always wanted a Stones tongue myself.</td>', 'Very cool tat, and original take on the challenge. Plus I love a die hard rock and roller. I always wanted a Stones tongue myself.', '2003-01-31 00:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204105, 11663, 3585, '<td valign="top">Austere ad beautifull, great picture, my only advice would be to use the "burn" tool to darken a bit the reflexion on the wet stone</td>', 'Austere ad beautifull, great picture, my only advice would be to use the "burn" tool to darken a bit the reflexion on the wet stone', '2003-01-31 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204116, 11661, 3084, '<td valign="top">I simply love RED, so you win.  It is a great image and I feel that it works so well because of the contrast between the red and the grey found in the balance the frame.  There is a bit of perspective error, but how do you correct it without a perspective control lens that most DPC members would not have or even be able to use.  My pick of the week.  Great job - 9</td>', 'I simply love RED, so you win.  It is a great image and I feel that it works so well because of the contrast between the red and the grey found in the balance the frame.  There is a bit of perspective error, but how do you correct it without a perspective control lens that most DPC members would not have or even be able to use.  My pick of the week.  Great job - 9', '2003-01-31 05:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(204117, 11623, 3084, '<td valign="top">Simply a wonderful image.  I am not a big green fan, but this image works so well, even with the green.  There is a certain cleanliness to this image that enhances it.  The perspective bothers me a bit, and it restricted my grading of the image slightly.  Wonderful architecture.</td>', 'Simply a wonderful image.  I am not a big green fan, but this image works so well, even with the green.  There is a certain cleanliness to this image that enhances it.  The perspective bothers me a bit, and it restricted my grading of the image slightly.  Wonderful architecture.', '2003-01-31 05:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204118, 11468, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great image - strong colours and shading, very good lighting, striking composition and very clean image.  Fun too, great job.</td>', 'Great image - strong colours and shading, very good lighting, striking composition and very clean image.  Fun too, great job.', '2003-01-31 05:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(204121, 11471, 5103, '<td valign="top">Excellent presentation. Well Done. very original concept</td>', 'Excellent presentation. Well Done. very original concept', '2003-01-31 07:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(204135, 11363, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful black and white... the perspective is excellent.. great shot! = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful black and white... the perspective is excellent.. great shot! = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-31 09:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(204136, 11536, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful architecture shot.. I love the patterns and ''texture'' displayed on this one.. black and white accents that very nicely.. .= 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful architecture shot.. I love the patterns and ''texture'' displayed on this one.. black and white accents that very nicely.. .= 10 - setzler', '2003-01-31 09:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(204137, 11505, 772, '<td valign="top">great shot.. I love the ''curve'' presented here and the yellow lighting tint works very well against the stained glass.. great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'great shot.. I love the ''curve'' presented here and the yellow lighting tint works very well against the stained glass.. great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-31 09:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(204139, 11433, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this shot... the lighting is excellent and the exposure is still showing the details in the dark areas of the shot... great work :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this shot... the lighting is excellent and the exposure is still showing the details in the dark areas of the shot... great work :) = 10 - setzler', '2003-01-31 09:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(204147, 11431, 3540, '<td valign="top">If you could''ve gotten the top of the teepee, I think it would''ve been preferred.  That little bit of difference would''ve made this look like a picture on the wall as opposed to a door, even with the shadows the way they are.  It looks not square to the pic but I think that''s the angle from which it was taken.  Nice shot - Inspzil</td>', 'If you could''ve gotten the top of the teepee, I think it would''ve been preferred.  That little bit of difference would''ve made this look like a picture on the wall as opposed to a door, even with the shadows the way they are.  It looks not square to the pic but I think that''s the angle from which it was taken.  Nice shot - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 09:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(204153, 11468, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great effect!  Love the colors and the slight pitch of the window too.  it really works for this pic.  Great job! - Inspzil</td>', 'Great effect!  Love the colors and the slight pitch of the window too.  it really works for this pic.  Great job! - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 09:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(204157, 11661, 3540, '<td valign="top">This pic needs to be squared up.  Red doors are okay.  The picture needs a little more of a focal point IMO. - Inspzil</td>', 'This pic needs to be squared up.  Red doors are okay.  The picture needs a little more of a focal point IMO. - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 09:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(204158, 11441, 3540, '<td valign="top">This pic needs to be a little sharper and maybe a little bigger wouldn''t hurt. -  Inspzil</td>', 'This pic needs to be a little sharper and maybe a little bigger wouldn''t hurt. -  Inspzil', '2003-01-31 09:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(204161, 11629, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best pet pictures I''ve seen on this sight.  I''m partial to Rot''s too.  The chin resting on the windowsill is the best.  The curtain is a slight distraction but only slight.  The look on the dogs face is enough for me to give this a 10.  But it is a biased 10 mind you.  So if you think it isn''t fair, PM me and I''ll knock it down to an 8 based solely on picture quality.  Great Pic!! - Inspzil</td>', 'This is one of the best pet pictures I''ve seen on this sight.  I''m partial to Rot''s too.  The chin resting on the windowsill is the best.  The curtain is a slight distraction but only slight.  The look on the dogs face is enough for me to give this a 10.  But it is a biased 10 mind you.  So if you think it isn''t fair, PM me and I''ll knock it down to an 8 based solely on picture quality.  Great Pic!! - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 09:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(204163, 11662, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture is hurting for some kind of focal point.  You could''ve PS''ed something into one of the windows to give it something.  It''s not quite sharp and also it''s just too drab. - Inspzil</td>', 'This picture is hurting for some kind of focal point.  You could''ve PS''ed something into one of the windows to give it something.  It''s not quite sharp and also it''s just too drab. - Inspzil', '2003-01-31 10:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(204172, 11488, 772, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.. I love the ''rustic'' look and the sepia tone adds quite a bit to that here... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is beautiful.. I love the ''rustic'' look and the sepia tone adds quite a bit to that here... great shot :) - setzler', '2003-01-31 10:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(204185, 11362, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but where''s the smoke?</td>', 'Great idea, but where''s the smoke?', '2003-01-31 11:06:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(204189, 11651, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  I really like the bluish color.  Couple of things to improve are the windows are a bit overexposed as is the area down next to the altar.  Maybe a shorter exposure time or longer one with a small aperture?  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  I really like the bluish color.  Couple of things to improve are the windows are a bit overexposed as is the area down next to the altar.  Maybe a shorter exposure time or longer one with a small aperture?  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-31 11:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(204191, 11663, 3599, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this photo.  I think this one will be in the top 10.  I don''t like the border but because it isn''t obtrusive I won''t mark it down.  I just don''t think it was nescessary to use.  Good job and good luck!</td>', 'Wow, I really like this photo.  I think this one will be in the top 10.  I don''t like the border but because it isn''t obtrusive I won''t mark it down.  I just don''t think it was nescessary to use.  Good job and good luck!', '2003-01-31 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(204192, 11364, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice macro of the eye.  The use of B&amp;W was a good choice.  I really like the detail of the pupil.  Great work, top 10 in my opinion.</td>', 'This is a very nice macro of the eye.  The use of B&W was a good choice.  I really like the detail of the pupil.  Great work, top 10 in my opinion.', '2003-01-31 11:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(204193, 11509, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and almost too digital in my opinion.  But it is very cool.  I would like to see how this was done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very abstract and almost too digital in my opinion.  But it is very cool.  I would like to see how this was done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-31 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(204196, 11504, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a nice silhoutte that should have been cropped too right above the window he is in front of.  If you look closely it is a little off center so I would have cropped a little off the right side to even things out a bit.  I like the border aournd this one.  Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice silhoutte that should have been cropped too right above the window he is in front of.  If you look closely it is a little off center so I would have cropped a little off the right side to even things out a bit.  I like the border aournd this one.  Nice work.', '2003-01-31 11:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(204197, 11441, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this and the framing.  I think if it were sharper it would be great.</td>', 'I like the colors in this and the framing.  I think if it were sharper it would be great.', '2003-01-31 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(204200, 11471, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very whimsical.  Looks like a jogsaw puzzle.  I think that this photo would have stood alone well without all of the effects added.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very whimsical.  Looks like a jogsaw puzzle.  I think that this photo would have stood alone well without all of the effects added.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-01-31 11:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(204256, 11482, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice lines.</td>', 'Nice lines.', '2003-01-31 13:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(204258, 11485, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, really good use of black and white too.</td>', 'Nice perspective, really good use of black and white too.', '2003-01-31 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(204259, 11404, 1826, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, looks nice and sharp.</td>', 'Good exposure, looks nice and sharp.', '2003-01-31 13:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(204261, 11498, 1826, '<td valign="top">Cool shot- The border being a bit wider on the left is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Cool shot- The border being a bit wider on the left is a bit distracting though.', '2003-01-31 13:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(204266, 11636, 1826, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled !   I think I would crop out the shrubs at the bottom, JMO though.</td>', 'Aptly titled !   I think I would crop out the shrubs at the bottom, JMO though.', '2003-01-31 13:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(204269, 11660, 1826, '<td valign="top">WOW!  This is such a cool shot. 10</td>', 'WOW!  This is such a cool shot. 10', '2003-01-31 13:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(204286, 11433, 1826, '<td valign="top">Good eye. Really like this.</td>', 'Good eye. Really like this.', '2003-01-31 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(204325, 11624, 5212, '<td valign="top">Brain twister, I assume.  Great creative shot.  Will be curious to see how you did this with one photo!</td>', 'Brain twister, I assume.  Great creative shot.  Will be curious to see how you did this with one photo!', '2003-01-31 14:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(204328, 11609, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very artistic interpretation of the challenge, like the use of desaturated area to emphasize the window.  I think I might have liked it better without the patterning in the window panes as it''s hard to figure out what that is about.</td>', 'Very artistic interpretation of the challenge, like the use of desaturated area to emphasize the window.  I think I might have liked it better without the patterning in the window panes as it''s hard to figure out what that is about.', '2003-01-31 14:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(204330, 11402, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great angle and cropping.  I might have like the sky a little desaturated if I would change anything, 9</td>', 'Great angle and cropping.  I might have like the sky a little desaturated if I would change anything, 9', '2003-01-31 14:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(204332, 11653, 5212, '<td valign="top">I love these spiral shots.  The only minor thing I might want to change is to darken up that glow just a little, which I know was likely difficult due to the setting of the shot.</td>', 'I love these spiral shots.  The only minor thing I might want to change is to darken up that glow just a little, which I know was likely difficult due to the setting of the shot.', '2003-01-31 14:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(204335, 11576, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the composition, the mood evoked, the use of color (and lack of) and the contrast.  The angle of the shot works for me too.  Very well done, one of my favorites, 9</td>', 'Great shot, love the composition, the mood evoked, the use of color (and lack of) and the contrast.  The angle of the shot works for me too.  Very well done, one of my favorites, 9', '2003-01-31 14:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(204338, 11409, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I''m not particularly crazy about this shot, I find it to be an interesting concept, and fairly well done.</td>', 'Though I''m not particularly crazy about this shot, I find it to be an interesting concept, and fairly well done.', '2003-01-31 14:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(204341, 11660, 5212, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture!  Good use of framing, contrast and color vs desaturated images in the shot.  Looks like you might have upped the blue, and it works well.  Maybe just a little bit of grain showing, but nothing major.</td>', 'Lovely capture!  Good use of framing, contrast and color vs desaturated images in the shot.  Looks like you might have upped the blue, and it works well.  Maybe just a little bit of grain showing, but nothing major.', '2003-01-31 14:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(204343, 11404, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to be more about the building as a whole than the windows and doors.  I like the look of the building against the negative space, but would have preferred a tighter crop; there is a little too much negative space for my tast.  The lighting is good on the building, and the repeating shapes are interesting.</td>', 'This shot seems to be more about the building as a whole than the windows and doors.  I like the look of the building against the negative space, but would have preferred a tighter crop; there is a little too much negative space for my tast.  The lighting is good on the building, and the repeating shapes are interesting.', '2003-01-31 14:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(204345, 11482, 2553, '<td valign="top">Interesting color, and repeating shapes, but it looks like an old industrial building, not a "city" building.  In this case, I think I would have preferred a more centered composition, especially if all of the windows on the right side were white - it would seem more balanced that way to me.</td>', 'Interesting color, and repeating shapes, but it looks like an old industrial building, not a "city" building.  In this case, I think I would have preferred a more centered composition, especially if all of the windows on the right side were white - it would seem more balanced that way to me.', '2003-01-31 14:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(204346, 11568, 5212, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this with a less black frame..  Although I think you idea was to help pull out the window as the focal point, I think it would have worked better without the frame or with the frame just slightly lighter and less thick.  Would liked window this to be more not on center, also, although it''s only a minor flaw in this particular shot, imo.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this with a less black frame..  Although I think you idea was to help pull out the window as the focal point, I think it would have worked better without the frame or with the frame just slightly lighter and less thick.  Would liked window this to be more not on center, also, although it''s only a minor flaw in this particular shot, imo.', '2003-01-31 14:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(204348, 11498, 5212, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, not sure whether or not how much I like the grain in the sky, although adds a bit of a surreal look to the photo.  Composition, contrast, lighting, addition of birds for perspective and interest very good.  The focus on the front looks either off or poorer due to light source, but it is still overall a very nice photo.</td>', 'This is a great photo, not sure whether or not how much I like the grain in the sky, although adds a bit of a surreal look to the photo.  Composition, contrast, lighting, addition of birds for perspective and interest very good.  The focus on the front looks either off or poorer due to light source, but it is still overall a very nice photo.', '2003-01-31 14:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(204349, 11381, 5212, '<td valign="top">Some jpg artifacts in the window frame (you must be using a camera like mine!).  The lighting could have been a bit more even, also.  Interesting interpretation of the challenge.  I do like how the images in the window seem to have a glowing effect, though.</td>', 'Some jpg artifacts in the window frame (you must be using a camera like mine!).  The lighting could have been a bit more even, also.  Interesting interpretation of the challenge.  I do like how the images in the window seem to have a glowing effect, though.', '2003-01-31 14:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(204350, 11383, 2553, '<td valign="top">On second look, I like this shot more than I did the first time.  I really like the color and interest of the stained glass, and though at first I thought the shot was a little dark, now I find that I really like the harsh shadows that show the definition of the "architecture" of the door.  I like that the door has a really old look to it, almost a smoky look.  Nice shot.</td>', 'On second look, I like this shot more than I did the first time.  I really like the color and interest of the stained glass, and though at first I thought the shot was a little dark, now I find that I really like the harsh shadows that show the definition of the "architecture" of the door.  I like that the door has a really old look to it, almost a smoky look.  Nice shot.', '2003-01-31 14:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(204351, 11631, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great idea, photo a bit busy for my taste and the stuff on the edges (esp the left edge) is distracting and am not wild about the lighting.  The inside of that room might have offered a good shot, too.</td>', 'Great idea, photo a bit busy for my taste and the stuff on the edges (esp the left edge) is distracting and am not wild about the lighting.  The inside of that room might have offered a good shot, too.', '2003-01-31 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(204352, 11639, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Might have liked this better if the window was lit rather than shadowed and the border a little more flat.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Might have liked this better if the window was lit rather than shadowed and the border a little more flat.', '2003-01-31 14:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(204353, 11518, 2553, '<td valign="top">The bushes in this shot really detract from it for me.  I would have loved a nice tight crop surrounding all the windows and really showcasing them.  The reflections of the trees are wonderful and provide so much interest.  The overall color on my monitor is blue, and I''m wondering if it was your white balance, or if possbly that color cast could have been removed in PS or a similar progra.  I think if the building was more of a nice stark white, it would have provided a wonderful contrast and really made the photo "pop".  Then again, maybe I''m completely off base and the building IS blue!!</td>', 'The bushes in this shot really detract from it for me.  I would have loved a nice tight crop surrounding all the windows and really showcasing them.  The reflections of the trees are wonderful and provide so much interest.  The overall color on my monitor is blue, and I''m wondering if it was your white balance, or if possbly that color cast could have been removed in PS or a similar progra.  I think if the building was more of a nice stark white, it would have provided a wonderful contrast and really made the photo "pop".  Then again, maybe I''m completely off base and the building IS blue!!', '2003-01-31 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(204354, 11625, 5212, '<td valign="top">This picture surely evokes thought and feeling.  Love the contrast, use of angles and curves, as well as it meeting the challenge very well.  Good luck, 10</td>', 'This picture surely evokes thought and feeling.  Love the contrast, use of angles and curves, as well as it meeting the challenge very well.  Good luck, 10', '2003-01-31 14:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(204413, 11653, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool. I''ll be interrested to find out where this was taken.</td>', 'Wow, very cool. I''ll be interrested to find out where this was taken.', '2003-01-31 19:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(204414, 11402, 1826, '<td valign="top">WOW!! You''re making me really dizzy. Great angle, wonderful detail and texture. 10!</td>', 'WOW!! You''re making me really dizzy. Great angle, wonderful detail and texture. 10!', '2003-01-31 19:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
