(204416, 11623, 3317, '<td valign="top">nice angle.</td>', 'nice angle.', '2003-01-31 19:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204417, 11489, 3317, '<td valign="top">old things, erosion, are compelling. makes me wish you were just a little bit closer. the knick-knacks are fine but not necessary, more compelling would be a close up with age''s details. even if it was just a corner of the window. nice though, you did good.</td>', 'old things, erosion, are compelling. makes me wish you were just a little bit closer. the knick-knacks are fine but not necessary, more compelling would be a close up with age''s details. even if it was just a corner of the window. nice though, you did good.', '2003-01-31 19:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(204419, 11524, 3317, '<td valign="top">perfect focus, real real nice. ten for you.</td>', 'perfect focus, real real nice. ten for you.', '2003-01-31 19:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(204420, 11625, 3317, '<td valign="top">amazing picture. lose the border. ten anyway.</td>', 'amazing picture. lose the border. ten anyway.', '2003-01-31 19:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(204433, 11468, 5212, '<td valign="top">This idea was similar to my entry, but much better done.  Congrats on a great photo.  I love the more artistic photos on this site.  Nothing I can say but that I find no faults with this photo, 10</td>', 'This idea was similar to my entry, but much better done.  Congrats on a great photo.  I love the more artistic photos on this site.  Nothing I can say but that I find no faults with this photo, 10', '2003-01-31 20:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(204440, 11651, 6520, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2003-01-31 20:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(204445, 11381, 6520, '<td valign="top">Nice wall decor</td>', 'Nice wall decor', '2003-01-31 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(204451, 11505, 6515, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.', '2003-01-31 21:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(204452, 11660, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the photo, other than the sky, is very dark on my monitor.  I like the look of the clouds in the window, but can''t tell if the blue color cast is because of the window, or because of white balance or other issues.  I would have liked to have seen more contrast in the clouds.  I''m not altogether crazy about the composition, but honestly don''t know how else it could have been done.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the photo, other than the sky, is very dark on my monitor.  I like the look of the clouds in the window, but can''t tell if the blue color cast is because of the window, or because of white balance or other issues.  I would have liked to have seen more contrast in the clouds.  I''m not altogether crazy about the composition, but honestly don''t know how else it could have been done.', '2003-01-31 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(204453, 11379, 2553, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, though I think I would have liked to see some "fill flash" to fill in the shadow at the top; decent composition.  Love the combination of colors, and the look of the bright new leaves against the old masonry and wood. On second look, I am rating this higher than I did at first - I really like it.</td>', 'Good lighting, though I think I would have liked to see some "fill flash" to fill in the shadow at the top; decent composition.  Love the combination of colors, and the look of the bright new leaves against the old masonry and wood. On second look, I am rating this higher than I did at first - I really like it.', '2003-01-31 21:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(204454, 11458, 2553, '<td valign="top">How cool is that??!  I love the whole look!  Nice color, and I love the crispness of the architectural details.  The only thing I''m "iffy" about is the loose puzzle piece - it seems to be floating in the air, and I would have expected to see it laying haphazardly on the ground in front of the doors.</td>', 'How cool is that??!  I love the whole look!  Nice color, and I love the crispness of the architectural details.  The only thing I''m "iffy" about is the loose puzzle piece - it seems to be floating in the air, and I would have expected to see it laying haphazardly on the ground in front of the doors.', '2003-01-31 21:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(204456, 11489, 2553, '<td valign="top">My first thought is that it looks odd to see those things in the window of this old building.  I''m glad that the shot is in pretty good focus, I like the look of the old wood and the details of the old window.</td>', 'My first thought is that it looks odd to see those things in the window of this old building.  I''m glad that the shot is in pretty good focus, I like the look of the old wood and the details of the old window.', '2003-01-31 21:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(204457, 11443, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the composition you used of including the area surrounding the window even though it is pretty dark on my monitor.  The window itself is awesome, I would have been so tempted to do a closeup of some of the window details; I imagine that it could be breathtaking.</td>', 'I like the composition you used of including the area surrounding the window even though it is pretty dark on my monitor.  The window itself is awesome, I would have been so tempted to do a closeup of some of the window details; I imagine that it could be breathtaking.', '2003-01-31 21:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(204458, 11624, 2553, '<td valign="top">Got to admit, this made me smile.  I love your use of color, but think that the composition could have been a little more dynamic.  I also think I would have been very tempted to crop out the wall on the left, giving the shot a more "wide-open space" feel.</td>', 'Got to admit, this made me smile.  I love your use of color, but think that the composition could have been a little more dynamic.  I also think I would have been very tempted to crop out the wall on the left, giving the shot a more "wide-open space" feel.', '2003-01-31 21:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(204461, 11387, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the tight composition and the look of the old wood and brick - would have loved to see more saturation of the brick color.</td>', 'I like the tight composition and the look of the old wood and brick - would have loved to see more saturation of the brick color.', '2003-01-31 21:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(204462, 11603, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the texture of the walls and the vines hanging down.  The repeating lines on the door really make it stand out.  I like your composition very much.  I would have been very tempted to saturate both the door and the vines!</td>', 'Love the texture of the walls and the vines hanging down.  The repeating lines on the door really make it stand out.  I like your composition very much.  I would have been very tempted to saturate both the door and the vines!', '2003-01-31 21:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(204464, 11493, 2553, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this is not very high impact for me, largely because of the soft focus.  With all the repeating patterns, as well as the "character" of the peeling paint, I would have loved to see this in sharp focus.  The shot does carry a certain air of "old", "decay", and "abandonment".  For voting purposes, I am taking into consideration that your camera may not have been capable of a sharper focus.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this is not very high impact for me, largely because of the soft focus.  With all the repeating patterns, as well as the "character" of the peeling paint, I would have loved to see this in sharp focus.  The shot does carry a certain air of "old", "decay", and "abandonment".  For voting purposes, I am taking into consideration that your camera may not have been capable of a sharper focus.', '2003-01-31 22:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(204465, 11523, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely texture, color and focus.  Not at all crazy about the composition.</td>', 'Lovely texture, color and focus.  Not at all crazy about the composition.', '2003-01-31 22:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(204466, 11609, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the window, and the shadows of the branches!  Terrific lighting for the shot.  The tree trunk ruins it all for me, though!  I would love to see a shot of JUST the window and the shadows.  Cool idea though.</td>', 'Absolutely love the window, and the shadows of the branches!  Terrific lighting for the shot.  The tree trunk ruins it all for me, though!  I would love to see a shot of JUST the window and the shadows.  Cool idea though.', '2003-01-31 22:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(204467, 11464, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, love the colors, as well as the patterns in the glass or whatever it is.</td>', 'Cool shot, love the colors, as well as the patterns in the glass or whatever it is.', '2003-01-31 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(204468, 11554, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the color of the barn.  Nice choice of subject; lots of interest with the vines growing all over the place.</td>', 'Love the color of the barn.  Nice choice of subject; lots of interest with the vines growing all over the place.', '2003-01-31 22:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(204470, 11488, 2553, '<td valign="top">This ties with one other shot for my absolute favorite this week.  This shot is just fabulous.  The building looks crooked to me, but I''m not sure that it is!  The black and white is perfect for this shot, and this building looks absolutely charming.  I would SO love to know where this is.  I love your composition - I think that I would have taken a tight shot of just the building, leaving out the sidewalk, and I also think that it would have been a mistake to do that!! Adding the sidewalk really gives it a great sense of "place".  Congrats, I would hang this on my walls in a heartbeat.</td>', 'This ties with one other shot for my absolute favorite this week.  This shot is just fabulous.  The building looks crooked to me, but I''m not sure that it is!  The black and white is perfect for this shot, and this building looks absolutely charming.  I would SO love to know where this is.  I love your composition - I think that I would have taken a tight shot of just the building, leaving out the sidewalk, and I also think that it would have been a mistake to do that!! Adding the sidewalk really gives it a great sense of "place".  Congrats, I would hang this on my walls in a heartbeat.', '2003-01-31 22:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(204471, 11653, 2553, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking in every aspect: color, composition, lighting and subject.  One of the  top three for sure this week.  Congrats on an amazing shot!</td>', 'Breathtaking in every aspect: color, composition, lighting and subject.  One of the  top three for sure this week.  Congrats on an amazing shot!', '2003-01-31 22:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(204473, 11496, 2553, '<td valign="top">An absolutely charming shot, it looks like a church, and if so, I wish I could go there.  Lighting, composition, and color all wonderful.  One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'An absolutely charming shot, it looks like a church, and if so, I wish I could go there.  Lighting, composition, and color all wonderful.  One of my favorites this week.', '2003-01-31 22:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(204474, 11651, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is incredible!  The repeating patterns and shapes are just awesome.  The shot really conveys the imposing magnificence of the space.  I''m not at all certain if the color is for real, or if all that blue is a manipulation, but whatever it is, it is inspired.</td>', 'Wow, this is incredible!  The repeating patterns and shapes are just awesome.  The shot really conveys the imposing magnificence of the space.  I''m not at all certain if the color is for real, or if all that blue is a manipulation, but whatever it is, it is inspired.', '2003-01-31 22:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(204475, 11513, 2553, '<td valign="top">While I would have loved to have been able to see more of the window frame, I still like the shot a lot.  Even the manipulation of the trees in the window work for me, giving it kind of a semi-abstract look that fits the shot.</td>', 'While I would have loved to have been able to see more of the window frame, I still like the shot a lot.  Even the manipulation of the trees in the window work for me, giving it kind of a semi-abstract look that fits the shot.', '2003-01-31 22:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(204476, 11663, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot except for one thing:  I would have liked to have seen more contrast.  Except for the top part of the doorway, it seems to have the same tone overall, reducing the impact that I think it could have had.</td>', 'I really love this shot except for one thing:  I would have liked to have seen more contrast.  Except for the top part of the doorway, it seems to have the same tone overall, reducing the impact that I think it could have had.', '2003-01-31 22:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
