(204989, 11509, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I like the beams of light, but I''m not sure about the ripples. The composition is great, I love all the lines in this image.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I like the beams of light, but I''m not sure about the ripples. The composition is great, I love all the lines in this image.', '2003-02-02 11:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
