(204998, 11364, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the extremely shallow DOF. Gorgeous black and white too. I''ve seen a lot of eye photos on this site (I bet someone will do it in the cliche challenge too!) but this is definitely one of the nicer ones.</td>', 'I love the extremely shallow DOF. Gorgeous black and white too. I''ve seen a lot of eye photos on this site (I bet someone will do it in the cliche challenge too!) but this is definitely one of the nicer ones.', '2003-02-02 12:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(205001, 11381, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice montage. This challenge seemed to be a great way for people to reuse their nicest photos by sticking them in a window :P. But this one works really well. The window itself is a great shape and beautifully lit, and the rainbow in the sky is a great touch. That almost looks like a watercolour painting in there.</td>', 'Nice montage. This challenge seemed to be a great way for people to reuse their nicest photos by sticking them in a window :P. But this one works really well. The window itself is a great shape and beautifully lit, and the rainbow in the sky is a great touch. That almost looks like a watercolour painting in there.', '2003-02-02 12:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(205004, 11431, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a little bit busy and confusing. It also seems slightly slanted, or maybe it''s a bit of perspective. The walls seem Japanese or something, and th wigwam outside is interesting, but it''s hard to mentally process what''s going on in this photo.</td>', 'This is a little bit busy and confusing. It also seems slightly slanted, or maybe it''s a bit of perspective. The walls seem Japanese or something, and th wigwam outside is interesting, but it''s hard to mentally process what''s going on in this photo.', '2003-02-02 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(205007, 11644, 1037, '<td valign="top">Lovely perspective! I like the sepia tones too. Also, the pattern of light and shadow on the ground is really nice. The sky seems a bit overexposed in some places, but I don''t mind that. I like this photo a lot. 10.</td>', 'Lovely perspective! I like the sepia tones too. Also, the pattern of light and shadow on the ground is really nice. The sky seems a bit overexposed in some places, but I don''t mind that. I like this photo a lot. 10.', '2003-02-02 12:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
