(205055, 11651, 1037, '<td valign="top">Amazing colours and great composition. It''s odd to see such a bright, colourful depiction of a church. Makes it seem like religion can be fun, like a circus :P.</td>', 'Amazing colours and great composition. It''s odd to see such a bright, colourful depiction of a church. Makes it seem like religion can be fun, like a circus :P.', '2003-02-02 13:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
