(205722, 11426, 255, '<td valign="top">what? i never commented on this pic? whats my problem? :)<br/>i loved this photo for the surrealism--incredibly imaginitive-- i feel like i am looking into one of dali''s dreams! the look on your face reaching for the door in the floor is fantastic. this pic should have placed!</td>', 'what? i never commented on this pic? whats my problem? :)i loved this photo for the surrealism--incredibly imaginitive-- i feel like i am looking into one of dali''s dreams! the look on your face reaching for the door in the floor is fantastic. this pic should have placed!', '2003-02-03 04:43:14.000000', NULL, 0),
